sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Client A
  participant G as Gateway / ARP proxy
  participant B as 192.168.24.65

  Note over A: /20 route says destination is on-link
  A->>G: ARP broadcast: Who has 192.168.24.65?
  G-->>A: 192.168.24.65 is at 02:00:00:00:00:01
  Note over A: Cache IP-to-MAC mapping
  A->>G: Ethernet dst = gateway MAC<br/>IP dst = 192.168.24.65
  Note over G: Route IP packet<br/>decrement TTL
  G->>B: New link-layer frame<br/>same IP destination
  B-->>G: Reply
  G-->>A: Forwarded reply
